  "body": "### Summary\nAs a user, I want the forum list to show every sub-forum HFR has, so that no forum is hidden because the home page lists only some of them (Programmation shows 14 of 27, Overclocking 6 of 7).\n\nBlocked by: 285 (capture).\n\nScope\n- Source the sub-forum list from REST `subcategories/` (LOT-057). The home page stays the primary source and `SubforumInjection` the fallback; or complete `SubforumInjection` from the capture.\n- Keep the \"Tous les sujets\" row (`ForumListModel.swift`) and the dedupe by path.\n\nLegacy citations: `ObjCForumsParser.m:84-109` (page links), `:88-96` (category entry), `:111-503` (injections). Current Swift: `SubforumInjection.swift`, `ForumListParser.swift:121-138`, LOT-021 §Sub-forum injection.\n\nParity note (checked 2026-10-28): SwiftHFR already reproduces the legacy list. This lot only closes a completeness gap that the legacy also has.\n\nAcceptance criteria\n- In a test against the capture, each category shows the REST `count` of sub-forums.\n- Every injected forum is checked against the capture; any that is not there is removed from the table.\n- Order stays page order; injected entries keep their legacy place.\n\nRow in docs/LOTS.md to add by docs PR (next free LOT number).\n",
